WEBVTT

00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:05.500
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.250
Make sure you're in a well- lit room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:23.970
When I open this door
Kono doa akereba atarashii sekai ga

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:27.860
A brand new world is starting right now
Ima hajimarunda

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:34.440
Even if there are painful things on my way
Tsurai koto ga aru toshitemo

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:40.840
I will show you that I can overcome them all
Kitto norikoetemiseru

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:48.600
I'm starting to walk on a brand new world now
Atarashii sekai ni ima arukidashita soko ha

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:54.830
And I'm sure there are [Dreams] and [Hope] there
[Yume] ya [Kibou] ga aru kara

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:58.050
This feeling is making my heart beat so fast
Dokidoki suru kono kimochi

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:01.180
And there's no one who can stop it
darenimo tomerarenai

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:06.200
My heart is tightening and jumping all over the place
Kyun to hazumu kokoro

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:10.560
So start flapping your wings from now
Koko kara habataiteiku

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:13.610
and soar high to the sky up there
ano sora he to takaku

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:19.580
Aiming for [Tomorrow] and [The Future] beyond
[Ashita] [Mirai] mezashite

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:22.910
We will definitely grow bigger someday
Itsuka ookiku nareru to

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:26.180
That's what I believed
sou shinjiteiru no

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:31.340
That's why, just spread your wings
Dakara tsubasa wo hiroge

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:54.750
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:57.500
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:04.070
<i>In order to bring peace back to Deltora, I defeated evil monsters and recovered the topaz, ruby and opal!</i>

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:07.090
<i>Honestly... You're always just being reckless though.</i>

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:07.840
<i>Jasmine!</i>

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:10.040
<i>It's all thanks to me that you even got this far.</i>

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:11.600
<i>And don't forget about me either.</i>

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:12.500
<i>Barda!</i>

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:15.600
<i>Filli! Kree!</i>

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:20.200
<i>We are in the middle of our journey to search for the seven gems!</i>

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:24.700
<i>And right now, we're on our way to the
Shifting Sands where the fourth gem is hidden!</i>

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:34.100
A lock?

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:35.600
Don't tell me...

00:02:36.980 --> 00:02:39.200
W-We're trapped here?!

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:45.300
Just what is happening...?!

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:49.500
What are you guys doing here?

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:53.000
Could it be that you're trying to run away from here?

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:55.300
That's not it...

00:02:55.300 --> 00:03:00.500
But, we were wanting to forfeit the Rithmere Games and continue on our journey.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:06.610
Unfortunately for you, once registered, you aren't allowed to change your mind, you know?

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:10.530
Even if you want to quit, it's just not possible.

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:12.300
No way...

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:16.820
Then, isn't this the same as treating us like prisoners?!

00:03:17.490 --> 00:03:20.530
No one here thinks that they're prisoners, though.

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:21.830
But...

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:27.000
Anyway, you'd better get back to your room and have a good rest,

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:28.910
Little Missy.

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:39.500
What do we do?

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:42.750
Let's just go to our room for now.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:47.000
We're too tired to think calmly right now.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:52.550
I'm sure that we can think of something after we've had a good night's sleep.

00:03:52.550 --> 00:03:54.000
You're probably right...

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:56.700
Alright, let's go then.

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.200
What's wrong, Jasmine?

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:16.100
Someone is following us.

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:20.200
Seems like there's more to this inn than meets the eye...

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:21.900
Keep your guard up.

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:22.900
Yeah.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:39.790
We're almost there. It's just up ahead.

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:43.980
Who's that?!

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:51.800
Are you both alright?

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:53.920
Jasmine...?

00:04:57.180 --> 00:04:58.860
I scratched him...!

00:04:58.860 --> 00:04:59.930
Scratched?

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:03.500
Yeah. I'm scary when I'm angry, you know?

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:07.000
I don't know who that person was, but if he even stooped this low...

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:09.800
Fine, I'll enter these 'Games'!

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:14.100
But <i>you</i>  suggested that we withdraw after eating...

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.170
I changed my mind.

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:17.200
Oh no...!

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:19.200
What's wrong?

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:22.400
Looks like he's stolen our room key.

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:26.100
And in its place, I found this thing on me.

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:37.800
"Don't win tomorrow if you still value your lives"...?

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:42.460
It looks like he's trying to threaten us into forfeiting!

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:45.000
What a coward.

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:51.500
I don't know nor care who he is, but he sure made a mistake attacking us.

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:59.600
This way, I doubt anyone can easily get in.

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:09.000
That guy probably thinks that we'll be too worried to sleep because he has our room key with him.

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:13.950
Yeah, I'm sure that his plan was to wear us down by depriving us of sleep.

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:17.400
If so, then he sure is simple- minded.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:19.400
We'll be sleeping soundly.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:23.200
After all, there's nothing to fear.

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:31.370
I really can't wait to expose that assailant's true identity; just imagine stooping so low.

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:33.100
Yeah, really.

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:37.500
I wonder if he realises that he's gone and antagonised us instead.

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:41.500
Let's do our best tomorrow.

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:14.700
Now, get up everyone! It's time for the tournament!

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:19.360
What is this...

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:22.000
It looks like it's locked...

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:24.000
Oh no!

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.100
He's locked the door from the outside!

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:28.800
He got us good.

00:07:32.270 --> 00:07:34.920
Open up! Hey, open up!

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:39.500
Someone, anyone, please let us out!

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:48.300
Mother Brightly!

00:07:49.430 --> 00:07:53.930
I was really worried since I didn't see you guys at the dining hall.

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:56.700
I thought that perhaps you had overslept.

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:58.600
That's not it.

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:02.000
Someone stole our room key and locked us in from the outside.

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:07.240
Oh my! To think that something like this could happen at my inn...

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:08.710
How embarassing...

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:15.000
I don't know what I can do to make it up to you... I'm truly sorry.

00:08:18.690 --> 00:08:23.000
I have big hopes for the three of you after all!

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:28.790
You'll definitely get past the preliminaries.

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:30.500
And everyone else thinks so too!

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:33.770
But at this rate, we're not going to make it...

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:35.900
It's alright, it's alright.

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:38.780
Now, follow me.

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:47.060
Now, drink all of this and get your strength up, okay?

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:56.420
I feel sorry for your opponents, after all, my favourite trio are no push-overs; rather, you're strong are you not?

00:08:56.420 --> 00:09:00.440
So, having said that, I shall await your demonstration.

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:02.400
Alright...

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:05.400
Queen Bee Cider, is it...?

00:09:09.300 --> 00:09:10.200
Delicious!

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:17.490
Yeah, it's good!

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:30.800
Guess it's too strong for kid, huh?

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:35.770
What?! Everyone has their own tastes, alright!

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:56.700
Welcome Ladies and Gentlemen to the opening of this year's Rithmere Games!

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:02.780
First of all, let us welcome one of the top contenders of the main tournament, Orwen, to pledge his oath of fair play!

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:04.500
There were this many of them...?

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.850
First of all, let us welcome one of the top contenders of the main tournament, Orwen, to pledge his oath of fair play!

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:13.940
See? We made it in time.

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:16.780
Yes, thank you very much.

00:10:17.270 --> 00:10:23.070
Give it your best out there, okay? I really have great hopes for you three!

00:10:23.610 --> 00:10:24.600
We'll be off, then.

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:32.000
We, the fighters who participate in the Rithmere Games swear that we will give everything we have in this event,

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:37.000
As well as fight with fairness and honour!

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:57.560
With the opening ceremony concluded,

00:10:57.560 --> 00:11:01.640
The fighters will be provided with three weapon types:

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:02.910
The Wedge,

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:06.000
Jabbock,

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:11.770
And Cell, of which only one can be chosen!

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:18.310
Weapons... I wonder which one I should pick...

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:22.700
What's the problem? Just pick the one that suits you best.

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:34.200
I'll go with this then.

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:40.550
Then I'm going to pick this!

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:41.810
And I...

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:45.280
I'll go with this one, I guess.

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:47.360
Lief.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:49.360
Look.

00:11:57.280 --> 00:12:00.110
Could it be that he was the one you scratched?

00:12:01.350 --> 00:12:03.450
Yeah, most likely.

00:12:07.690 --> 00:12:10.100
The rules are simple.

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:14.060
The contestants will fight each other all at once.

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:19.740
You will be declared defeated if you're removed from the ring or if you choose not to continue the fight.

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:25.810
Your strength, agility, cunning, as well as your endurance will be put to the test in this tournament.

00:12:25.860 --> 00:12:27.200
This crap...

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:30.730
I don't need anything like that!

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:32.710
My two hands are more than enough!

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:35.300
Are all the fighters ready?!

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:41.380
Now, let the fun begin!

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:56.810
Be careful, Jasmine.

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:01.400
Worry about yourself first before you worry about me.

00:13:12.010 --> 00:13:13.000
A girl?!

00:13:14.790 --> 00:13:18.310
I entered to bring the prize money back to my poor village.

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:20.840
Is that so...

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:22.600
That's why...

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:33.600
You're quite strong, aren't you?

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:37.000
Let's give it our all and survive the preliminaries together!

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:39.810
Thanks.

00:13:57.660 --> 00:14:00.800
I don't care who it's going to be! Come at me!

00:14:09.790 --> 00:14:12.500
Your strength is commendable.

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:15.300
However, it still won't enough to beat me!

00:14:18.060 --> 00:14:22.710
<i>Barda is a powerful warrior who once served at the Palace of Del as a guard.</i>

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:30.750
<i>Even after leaving the palace, Barda still continued to train his body while he helped at the smithy.</i>

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:44.610
Alright, that's one down!

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:47.900
Oh my! What an excellent display of raw strength!

00:14:49.890 --> 00:14:51.970
Where is he, that guy with the scar?!

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:52.510
I give up!
Where is he, that guy with the scar?!

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:52.910
I give up!

00:14:58.200 --> 00:14:59.000
There!

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:03.930
Your opponent is me.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:08.300
What's with you?! I don't have the time play around with you!

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:13.340
<i>Jasmine is a girl who grew up in the forest.</i>

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:19.330
<i>She's able to speak with trees, not to mention her amazing balance,</i>

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:22.320
<i>And her jumping power are second to none.</i>

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:46.390
Now you have nowhere to run.

00:15:59.690 --> 00:16:01.200
Don't underestimate me.

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:05.100
Climbing mean trees is much more difficult by comparison.

00:16:06.740 --> 00:16:08.630
What a nimble body!

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:16.610
I will be your opponent, little one.

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:35.600
<i>And in Lief's case, he was trained in the basics of swordsmanship by his father, Jarred, since his childhood.</i>

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:44.900
<i>Furthermore, his hobby back in Del was to make a game out of
antagonising the Grey Guards that everyone else were afraid of.</i>

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:51.890
<i>And before he knew it, he had learned how to gauge an enemy's strength in an instant.</i>

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:13.000
I... I give up...

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:15.000
Alright!

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:32.930
Good going Orwen! Let's get that boy over there next!

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:34.880
Sure!

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:46.840
You've done well to survive up to this point, kid.

00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:51.000
If he were to grab me, then...

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:06.000
It's useless! I can't see an opening!

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:23.380
Oh well... My target has been taken...

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:35.230
Haven't I fought more frightening opponents than this before?

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:36.160
<i>Gorl!!</i>

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:47.780
<i>Thaegan!!</i>

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:17.500
Heh, make sure to chew it well, okay?

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:20.500
I knew it.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:23.310
My judgment is never off.

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:26.200
I've owned my inn for a very long time, after all.

00:19:26.690 --> 00:19:29.040
Those three are no average travellers.

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:29.880
I'll borrow this!

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:33.120
Oh, he picked up a nice one.

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:44.700
Even though hurting a powerless little girl is in clear violation of the knight's code...

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:48.450
Moreover, it's a two against one fight... Do forgive us.

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:52.600
What are you trying to act cool for? You won't live long that way.

00:19:52.850 --> 00:19:53.940
You may be right.

00:19:54.930 --> 00:19:56.220
Then here we come!

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:01.490
Birdie!

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:03.140
I'm fine.

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:07.100
Just not sure who I should attack first!

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:09.710
This one!

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:14.870
Let it go!

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:16.200
Sure thing!

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:25.130
You coward!!

00:20:26.890 --> 00:20:28.610
Come on, Mister! I'm right here!

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:51.250
The preliminary stage is over!!

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:14.410
At this time, we have eight fighters who will compete in the main tournament!

00:21:20.770 --> 00:21:21.810
Their names are...

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:26.800
Top Contenders, the spouses Orwen and Joanna!

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:29.520
Neridah!

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:34.690
Oh, so she survived.

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:37.410
W-What?

00:21:38.370 --> 00:21:39.300
Nothing.

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:40.520
Glock!

00:21:44.510 --> 00:21:47.680
The trio Berry, Twig, and Birdie!

00:21:49.290 --> 00:21:51.000
That's us, right?

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:53.500
It just doesn't feel right...

00:21:54.390 --> 00:21:56.500
But, we'll get 100 gold coins with this!

00:21:57.540 --> 00:22:00.800
And last but not least, Doom!!

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:06.040
Doom...

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:09.900
So his name is Doom, then...

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:13.410
I'd doubt it's his real name.

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:15.820
Yeah. That guy is way too shady.

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:40.390
Every moment is a gate to fantasia
Every moment is a gate to fantasia

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:47.690
You just do it to be an shining star
You just do it to be an shining star

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:51.050
Ooh la la! The gentle wind that's brushing my cheek in the evening
Ooh la la! Yawarakana kaze hoo naderu yuugata

00:22:51.050 --> 00:22:53.560
If you start to walk with your head held high
Moshi kimi ga uemuki arukidasu nara

00:22:53.560 --> 00:22:57.980
The big red sun will surely give its blessing to you
Ooki na akai taiyou ga kimi wo shukufuku shitekureru darou

00:22:57.980 --> 00:23:00.480
If you stay stricken because you stumbled
Nanika ni tsumazuki uchihishigarete

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:02.780
And keep hanging your head in shame
Moshi kimi ga utsumuitamama nara

00:23:03.070 --> 00:23:05.070
Then you are probably going to miss
Sono kandouteki na ONE SCENE

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:07.840
That very touching one scene
Nogashite shimau kamoshirenai kara

00:23:07.840 --> 00:23:10.660
HEY NOW ! Everything that lives on this earth
HEY NOW ! Kono chikyuu de ikiru mono subete

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:13.210
Sea, Sky, Sun that blessed us in these 7 Days
Umi, sora to taiyou megumi no 7 DAYS

00:23:13.210 --> 00:23:16.010
Since when did I get this thirsty?
Itsu kara ka nodo kawakikittamama

00:23:16.010 --> 00:23:18.560
I turned my back to this town and kept walking away
Kono machi wo se ni ue ni ue ni "WALK AWAY"

00:23:18.560 --> 00:23:20.850
No matter how far or deep you look for it
Tooku made oku no oku made

00:23:20.850 --> 00:23:23.730
In the end, it's just a problem that you don't know the answer to
Mitetara kekkyoku wakaranai mondaiten

00:23:23.730 --> 00:23:25.790
Before saying that you can't go on anymore
Mou dame tte iu mae ni ippo

00:23:25.790 --> 00:23:28.110
That little bit of courage will surely bring forth the second chapter.
Sukoshi no yuuki de dai ni shou e kitto

00:23:28.110 --> 00:23:30.640
HEY NOW ! Let's draw on a brand new page
HEY NOW ! Arata na PAGE egakou

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:33.130
HEY NOW ! Take my hand and we gonna go
HEY NOW ! Te wo totte saa WE GONNA GO

00:23:33.130 --> 00:23:36.980
HEY NOW ! Whether you go up or down, it's the same second
HEY NOW ! Agattemo sagattemo onaji ichibyou

00:23:36.980 --> 00:23:38.140
GET UP ! STAND UP !
GET UP ! STAND UP !

00:23:38.140 --> 00:23:40.710
HEY NOW ! Let's draw on a brand new page
HEY NOW ! Arata na PAGE egakou

00:23:40.710 --> 00:23:43.250
HEY NOW ! Take my hand and we gonna go
HEY NOW ! Te wo totte saa WE GONNA GO

00:23:43.250 --> 00:23:47.090
HEY NOW ! Whetter you cry or laugh, it's just once for life
HEY NOW ! Naitemo warattemo tatta ikkai

00:23:47.090 --> 00:23:48.260
GET UP ! STAND UP !
GET UP ! STAND UP !

00:23:48.260 --> 00:23:58.330
HEY NOW ! La la la...
HEY NOW ! La la la la la la la la la la la la...

00:23:58.330 --> 00:23:59.290
HEY NOW !
HEY NOW !

00:24:03.390 --> 00:24:04.400
HEY NOW !
HEY NOW !

00:24:06.280 --> 00:24:08.200
<i>Queen Bee Cider.</i>

00:24:09.100 --> 00:24:15.300
<i>A valuable drink that can recover and boost the stamina of the drinker. Also an irreplaceable drink for the Rithmere Games.</i>

00:24:15.300 --> 00:24:19.290
<i>The Queen Bee Honey made from the same orchard is also really popular.</i>

00:24:20.290 --> 00:24:24.020
<i>I got to know more about Neridah and was cheered up by her.</i>

00:24:24.020 --> 00:24:27.720
<i>And the main tournament finally starts! Barda's opponent is Doom!</i>

00:24:28.190 --> 00:24:30.650
<i>While my opponent is... Neridah?!</i>

00:24:30.650 --> 00:24:31.340
FIGHT, FIGHT, LIEF

00:24:31.340 --> 00:24:34.320
<i>Next time, 'Fight, Fight, Lief'.
